    "modifier_lich_16_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Frost Shield.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Frost Blast Ring \n\n Casts Frost Blast after a short delay in a circle around the hero. \n\n Radius: 500 \n\n Cooldown: 7 seconds \n Mana Cost: 140",
    "modifier_lich_16_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Frost Shield.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Frost Blast Ring</font></b> \n\n Casts <b><font color='#eabe10'>Frost Blast</font></b> after a short delay in a circle around the hero. \n\n Radius: 500 \n\n Cooldown: 7 seconds \n Mana Cost: 140",
